{"finfr":{"titre":"Finance & économie","court":"Finance","desc":"Termes clés des marchés, de la comptabilité et de l'économie — utiles pour le CFA.","cards":[{"t":"Asset","d":"A resource with economic value owned or controlled by an entity."},{"t":"Liability","d":"A present financial obligation arising from past events."},{"t":"Equity","d":"The residual interest in assets after liabilities are deducted."},{"t":"Revenue","d":"Income generated from ordinary business operations."},{"t":"Expense","d":"A cost incurred in the process of earning revenue."},{"t":"Profit","d":"The financial gain remaining after all expenses are deducted."},{"t":"Loss","d":"The amount by which expenses exceed revenues."},{"t":"Cash Flow","d":"The net movement of cash into and out of a business."},{"t":"Operating Cash Flow","d":"Cash generated by core business operations."},{"t":"Free Cash Flow","d":"Cash remaining after capital expenditures."},{"t":"Capital","d":"Financial resources available for investment or production."},{"t":"Working Capital","d":"Current assets minus current liabilities."},{"t":"Current Asset","d":"An asset expected to be converted into cash within one year."},{"t":"Current Liability","d":"A liability due within one year."},{"t":"Fixed Asset","d":"A long-term tangible asset used in business operations."},{"t":"Intangible Asset","d":"A non-physical asset such as a patent or trademark."},{"t":"Depreciation","d":"Allocation of the cost of a tangible asset over its useful life."},{"t":"Amortization","d":"Allocation of the cost of an intangible asset over time."},{"t":"Impairment","d":"A permanent reduction in the value of an asset."},{"t":"Inventory","d":"Goods held for sale or production."},{"t":"Accounts Receivable","d":"Money owed to a business by its customers."},{"t":"Accounts Payable","d":"Money owed by a business to its suppliers."},{"t":"Accrual","d":"Recognition of revenues or expenses before cash changes hands."},{"t":"Provision","d":"A liability of uncertain timin